# Casa de la Hermana (the rival's house in Villa Aliso, sister's house; F2, contract 74; map id 177), 9 x 7, interior. column = i, row = j. A tidy girl's home: a bed, a table with a vase, a TV, a bookshelf and two planters.
# Atlas: the rival's sister gives it once the parcel was delivered to Profesora Lin (flag parcel_delivered 41 = the Registro, FLAG_REGISTRO): the ATLAS (item `atlas`, a key item, flag 926 = given). Before that she only says
# where her brother is; a full bag keeps the flag clear and she hands it over at the next talk.
@map casa_hermana
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@flag atlas_given 926
@flag parcel_delivered 41      # Profesora Lin received the parcel (villa_lab.map, script lin)
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=casa.books
  V  object=tv interact=look text=obj.tv
  P  object=planter
  b  object=bed
  T  object=table
  S  npc=chica id=sister face=S script=sister
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwywww
  |B.V.P..b
  |...S...b
  q....T...
  |.P......
  |........
  |...mm...
@warp m -> villa_aliso spawn=rival_door
@script sister npc
    npc_face_hero sister
    jf atlas_given said
    jnf parcel_delivered hi
    say herm.give
    give_item atlas 1
    jv 0 0 full
    setf atlas_given
    sfx item
    say herm.got
    say herm.about
    end
  hi:
    say herm.hi
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  said:
    say herm.after
@end
